## 🧬 Detailed NASA Study References & Parameters

* **1. OSD-993 & OSD-611 (Cellular Senescence & Transcriptomics):**
  * *Focus:* Analyzes human fibroblasts and space radiation responses, highlighting the accumulation of senescent cells (SnCs / SA-beta-gal+) and integrated stress pathway activations[span_8](start_span)[span_8](end_span)[span_9](start_span)[span_9](end_span).
  * *Access:* Directly referenced via [NASA OSDR Platform](https://osdr.nasa.gov/)[span_10](start_span)[span_10](end_span)[span_11](start_span)[span_11](end_span).

* **2. OSD-479 (Behavioral & Cognitive Assays):**
  * *Focus:* Multivariate principal components analysis measuring sex-dimorphic responses and impaired spatial learning in mouse models exposed to simulated Galactic Cosmic Radiation (GCRsim)[span_12](start_span)[span_12](end_span).

* **3. OSD-777 (Neuroinflammation & Microglia):**
  * *Focus:* Tracks chronic microglial activation and neuro-immune alterations within the hippocampus following high-energy charged particle exposure[span_13](start_span)[span_13](end_span).

* **4. OSD-778 (Synaptic Alterations):**
  * *Focus:* Maps structural hippocampal synaptic changes and neural plasticity degradation linked to deep space travel cognitive challenges[span_14](start_span)[span_14](end_span).

