## ☢️ Radiation & Extremophile (Tardigrade) Benchmarks
* **Mars Cruise Radiation Dose Rate:** Calibrated around baseline Galactic Cosmic Radiation (GCR) exposure parameters (~1.84 mSv/day)[span_15](start_span)[span_15](end_span).
* **Biological Resilience Countermeasure:** Integration of the Tardigrade (*Ramazzottius varieornatus*) Damage Suppressor (`Dsup`) protein sequence reference (`UniProt A0A226NRR3`) as an extremophile model for chromatin protection against radiolytic cleavage[span_16](start_span)[span_16](end_span).
